        \left(\frac{1+\nu}{1-\nu}\right)^\frac{1-\nu}{1+3\nu}\frac{\varepsilon^\frac{1-\nu}{1+3\nu}}{2^\frac{4+10\nu}{1+3\nu}M_\nu^\frac{2}{1+3\nu}}\frac{1+3\nu}{1+2\nu}k^{\frac{2+4\nu}{1+3\nu}}
